_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/359465837","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/4170#issuecomment-359465837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/4170","id":359465837,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1OTQ2NTgzNw==","user":{"login":"dslomov","id":5008223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDgyMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5008223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov","html_url":"https://github.com/dslomov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-22T15:50:02Z","updated_at":"2018-01-22T16:20:45Z","body":"Not really an external repo bug. It happens when an executable rule tries to provide the executable from a different package (and it is actually enabled by a  https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/3826, where we enabled arbitrary artifacts as executables). The small(er) repro is:\r\n\r\nrulez.bzl\r\n```python\r\ndef  _impl(ctx):\r\n  return [DefaultInfo(executable = ctx.executable.runme,\r\n                      files = depset([ctx.executable.runme]),\r\n                     )]\r\n\r\n\r\nr = rule(_impl,\r\n         executable = True,\r\n         attrs = {\r\n             \"runme\" : attr.label(executable = True, mandatory = True),\r\n         },\r\n)\r\n```\r\ntools/BUILD:\r\n```python\r\nsh_binary(name = \"tryme\",\r\n          srcs = [\":tryme.sh\"],\r\n          visibility = [\"//visibility:public\"],\r\n)\r\n```\r\nsrc/BUILD\r\n```python\r\nload(\"//:rulez.bzl\", \"r\")\r\nr(name = \"r_tools\", runme = \"//tools:tryme\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nEDITS: some minimization of the example","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/359465837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dslomov","id":5008223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDgyMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5008223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov","html_url":"https://github.com/dslomov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/359474900","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/4170#issuecomment-359474900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/4170","id":359474900,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1OTQ3NDkwMA==","user":{"login":"dslomov","id":5008223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDgyMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5008223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","u